CHAPTER.VERS:
In that thou buildest thy eminent place in the head of every way, and makest thy high place in every street; and hast not been as an harlot, 

          Meaning that some harlots contemn small rewards but no lovers gave a reward to Israel, but they gave to all others signifying that the idolaters bestow all their substance which they receive from God for his glory to serve their vile abominations.
         in that thou scornest hire;
